# UI Design System & Styling Patterns

## 🎨 Design System Overview

### shadcn/ui Components
The project uses shadcn/ui components located in `components/ui/` for consistent design:

- **Buttons**: [button.jsx](mdc:components/ui/button.jsx) - Primary, secondary, and variant buttons
- **Cards**: [card.jsx](mdc:components/ui/card.jsx) - Content containers with consistent styling
- **Dialogs**: [dialog.jsx](mdc:components/ui/dialog.jsx) - Modal dialogs and overlays
- **Forms**: [input.jsx](mdc:components/ui/input.jsx), [label.jsx](mdc:components/ui/label.jsx) - Form elements
- **Tables**: [table.jsx](mdc:components/ui/table.jsx) - Data display tables
- **Charts**: [chart.jsx](mdc:components/ui/chart.jsx) - Data visualization components

### Tailwind CSS Configuration
- **Version**: Tailwind CSS v4
- **Configuration**: [postcss.config.mjs](mdc:postcss.config.mjs)
- **Custom Classes**: Defined in [app/globals.css](mdc:app/globals.css)

## 🎯 Component Styling Patterns

### Button Variants
```javascript
// Primary button
<Button variant="default" size="default">
  Submit Vote
</Button>

// Secondary button
<Button variant="secondary" size="sm">
  Cancel
</Button>

// Destructive button
<Button variant="destructive">
  Delete Candidate
</Button>

// Outline button
<Button variant="outline">
  Edit Details
</Button>
```

### Card Layouts
```javascript
// Basic card
<Card>
  <CardHeader>
    <CardTitle>Candidate Information</CardTitle>
    <CardDescription>View candidate details</CardDescription>
  </CardHeader>
  <CardContent>
    {/* Content */}
  </CardContent>
  <CardFooter>
    {/* Actions */}
  </CardFooter>
</Card>

// Interactive card
<Card className="hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow cursor-pointer">
  <CardContent className="p-6">
    {/* Content */}
  </CardContent>
</Card>
```

### Form Patterns
```javascript
// Form with validation
<form onSubmit={handleSubmit} className="space-y-4">
  <div className="space-y-2">
    <Label htmlFor="name">Candidate Name</Label>
    <Input
      id="name"
      name="name"
      value={formData.name}
      onChange={handleInputChange}
      placeholder="Enter candidate name"
      required
    />
  </div>
  
  <Button type="submit" disabled={isLoading}>
    {isLoading ? 'Saving...' : 'Save Candidate'}
  </Button>
</form>
```

### Modal/Dialog Patterns
```javascript
// Confirmation dialog
<Dialog open={isOpen} onOpenChange={setIsOpen}>
  <DialogContent>
    <DialogHeader>
      <DialogTitle>Confirm Action</DialogTitle>
      <DialogDescription>
        Are you sure you want to delete this candidate?
      </DialogDescription>
    </DialogHeader>
    <DialogFooter>
      <Button variant="outline" onClick={() => setIsOpen(false)}>
        Cancel
      </Button>
      <Button variant="destructive" onClick={handleDelete}>
        Delete
      </Button>
    </DialogFooter>
  </DialogContent>
</Dialog>
```

## 📱 Responsive Design

### Breakpoint System
```javascript
// Mobile-first approach
<div className="w-full md:w-1/2 lg:w-1/3">
  {/* Content */}
</div>

// Responsive grid
<div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
  {/* Grid items */}
</div>

// Responsive text
<h1 className="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold">
  Election Results
</h1>
```

### Mobile Navigation
```javascript
// Collapsible sidebar for mobile
<div className="lg:hidden">
  <Button variant="ghost" size="sm" onClick={toggleSidebar}>
    <Menu className="h-4 w-4" />
  </Button>
</div>

// Desktop sidebar
<div className="hidden lg:block">
  {/* Sidebar content */}
</div>
```

## 🎨 Color System

### Primary Colors
- **Primary**: Blue shades for main actions
- **Secondary**: Gray shades for secondary elements
- **Accent**: Highlight colors for important information
- **Destructive**: Red shades for dangerous actions

### Semantic Colors
```javascript
// Success states
<div className="text-green-600 bg-green-50 border-green-200">
  Vote submitted successfully!
</div>

// Error states
<div className="text-red-600 bg-red-50 border-red-200">
  Error: Please try again
</div>

// Warning states
<div className="text-yellow-600 bg-yellow-50 border-yellow-200">
  Warning: Election ends soon
</div>

// Info states
<div className="text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 border-blue-200">
  Info: New candidates added
</div>
```

## 📊 Data Visualization

### Chart Components
```javascript
// Bar chart for election results
<BarChart data={results} className="w-full h-64">
  <Bar dataKey="votes" fill="#3b82f6" />
  <XAxis dataKey="candidate" />
  <YAxis />
  <Tooltip />
</BarChart>

// Pie chart for party distribution
<PieChart data={partyData} className="w-full h-64">
  <Pie dataKey="value" data={partyData} />
  <Tooltip />
</PieChart>
```

### Progress Indicators
```javascript
// Voting progress
<Progress value={votingProgress} className="w-full" />

// Loading states
<div className="flex items-center space-x-2">
  <div className="animate-spin rounded-full h-4 w-4 border-b-2 border-primary"></div>
  <span>Loading...</span>
</div>
```

## 🎭 Animation & Transitions

### Hover Effects
```javascript
// Card hover effects
<Card className="transition-all duration-200 hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1">
  {/* Content */}
</Card>

// Button hover effects
<Button className="transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-primary/90">
  Click me
</Button>
```

### Loading Animations
```javascript
// Skeleton loading
<div className="animate-pulse">
  <div className="h-4 bg-gray-200 rounded w-3/4"></div>
  <div className="h-4 bg-gray-200 rounded w-1/2 mt-2"></div>
</div>

// Spinner animation
<div className="animate-spin rounded-full h-6 w-6 border-b-2 border-primary"></div>
```

